OL,3,GNEWSACordon removed after WW2 bomb
OL,4,Aremoved from docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two bomb that prompted the
OL,7,Fevacuation of hundreds of homes has
OL,8,Fbeen safely removed from a harbour
OL,9,Farea.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FFalmouth Docks in Cornwall at 09:15 BST
OL,13,Fon Monday after the suspected 250lb
OL,14,F(115kg) "air-dropped" device was found
OL,15,Fin the water.
OL,17,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone was put
OL,18,Fin place on Tuesday and expanded to
OL,19,F755m (2,477ft) on Wednesday with
OL,20,Fresidents from more than 300 homes
OL,21,Fasked to leave before 09:00 BST ahead
OL,22,Fof the bomb being moved.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
