OL,3,GNEWSACordon removed after WW2 bomb
OL,4,Aremoved from docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council confirmed the
OL,7,Funexploded bomb had been "safely
OL,8,Fremoved from Falmouth Docks" before
OL,9,F16:00, the cordon removed and residents
OL,10,Fallowed to return to their homes.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
